  void RestoreAndMarkClean(string source){if(!sessionReady||!recovery.HasDirtySession)return;if(recovery.RestoreCurrentSession(displays,gamma,softwareSat,out var restoreError))recovery.MarkClean();else recovery.Log(source+" restore failed: "+restoreError);}
  void SessionEnding(object s,SessionEndingEventArgs e){exiting=true;gameTimer.Stop();hardwareTimer.Stop();recoveryTimer.Stop();RestoreAndMarkClean("Windows session ending");}
